[--label …] (several numbers — one batch, one signature) | baseline <server>|all | trust <ip|cidr> --label … (accept, baseline and trust are only
monitor_trust proposals: the monitor applies them after the owner's signature) | trust --remove <ip|cidr> | expect begin|end [<server>] --label …
(a release window — root installers only) — the monitor of the sysadmin's problems (delivery, registry, baseline). Thresholds are in
agents/sysadmin/monitor/config.json (the memory of small servers in MB — mem_available_mb.<server>)."""
